      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}, This is an understandable reason. I would however nitpick correct you by saying that a world can't read the log file, only external applications can and some indeed do and they already have to change because of these changes.\n\nThe whole point of the Open Beta is to test this and see how it works, so we are giving feedback on how this right now is making some issues. It isn't live yet.",
