      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Could also change the log entry delimiter to `\"\\r\\r\\n\"`, since the extra carriage return char would likely be ignored by most text programs, and it would make the log entry delimiter easier to detect programmatically.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
